# Definition of Done

Phase 1 is complete when:

* [ ] Pipelines persist
* [ ] Execution is async
* [ ] Runtime registry exists
* [ ] Runs are stored
* [ ] Validation layer is structured
* [ ] Execution logs are inspectable
* [ ] Architecture is modular and scalable
